    355  0ae0							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    356  0ae0							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    357  0ae0							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    358  0ae0							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
